-- Other-spec Tier 1 and Tier 2 set pieces for the tier-token exchange at Overlord Runthak (14392) and Major
-- Mattingly (14394), added to the lists 91000001-91000008 of rev_20261001_60_molten_core_tier_token_vendors.sql.
--
-- Items: exactly the rows both vendors sell in the Exiles DB export of 2026-09-13 (npc_vendor 14392/14394, identical)
-- that those lists leave out. Tier 1: item sets 406, 1205, 1208, 1209, 1210, 1219, 1223, 1226, 1227, 1321 and 2020.
-- Tier 2: item sets 404, 1211, 1214, 1216, 1217, 1218, 1224, 1228, 2021 and 2214. The export sells only the head,
-- shoulder, chest and legs pieces of these sets, and only the Normal (+0), Heroic (+300000) and Ascended (+200000)
-- clones, so the Mythic lists and the wrist, waist, hands and feet pieces are left unchanged.
-- Costs: one token of the slot and difficulty, the same ExtendedCost the classic-set list of that tier and
-- difficulty uses for the slot after rev_20261001_84_molten_core_vendor_mythic_ascended_swap.sql.
-- The lists grow from 80 to 124 (T1) and 120 (T2) items, within the 150 a vendor list shows (MAX_VENDOR_ITEMS).
